        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jelena Janković, Marat Safin, Elena Dementieva, Radek Štěpánek\n- Events: 2004 BNP Paribas Masters – Singles, 2008 Kremlin Cup – Women's Singles\n- Roles: professional tennis player, retired professional tennis player, politician\n\nFacts:\n- Marat Safin, born on 27 January 1980, is a Russian politician and retired professional tennis player.\n- Jelena Janković, born on 28 February 1985, is a Serbian professional tennis player.\n- At the 2004 BNP Paribas Masters – Singles, Marat Safin won the title for a then-record third time by defeating Radek Štěpánek in the final in straight sets.\n- At the 2008 Kremlin Cup – Women's Singles, defending champion Elena Dementieva lost in the semifinals to Jelena Janković.",
